  "body": "From #105 @domenic writes:\r\n> This implies a storage mechanism, which raises a lot of questions. E.g., how long is this storage retained? Does it get cleared when cookies are cleared? Is it scoped to origin, to site, to Window-plus-workers-directly-or-indirectly-owned-by-that-Window, ...?\r\n>\r\n> Probably this would benefit from some explicit specification of the storage mechanism.\r\n\r\n[WebUSB](https://wicg.github.io/webusb/#permission-api) and [Web Bluetooth](https://webbluetoothcg.github.io/web-bluetooth/#permission-api-integration) do this through integration with [[[PERMISSIONS]]](https://w3c.github.io/permissions).",
